# User Edit Persistence

When the user edits CSS or other code in the IDE (gap, padding, colors, etc.):

- Treat their current file values as the source of truth
- Do not ask for a separate “save” confirmation
- Do not revert their manual changes when continuing work
- If they say they changed something, read the file and keep those values
